---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';

const description = '受保护地预览 My Skill Library 的公开 GitHub Skill 来源。';
---

<SiteLayout title="管理后台 — My Skill Library" description={description} noindex>
  <main id="main-content" class="page-shell admin-shell">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="面包屑">
      <a href="/">首页</a>
      <span class="breadcrumb-separator" aria-hidden="true">
        /
      </span>
      <span aria-current="page">管理后台</span>
    </nav>

    <section class="detail-hero admin-hero" aria-labelledby="admin-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> PRIVATE WORKSPACE
      </p>
      <h1 id="admin-title">管理后台</h1>
      <p class="detail-description">
        预览公开 GitHub Skill 来源，并在可视化编辑器中修改已发布条目。管理员身份由 Cloudflare Access
        与 Worker
        服务端共同验证；页面隐藏不作为安全边界。草稿只保存在当前浏览器，本阶段不会发布内容。
      </p>
      <div class="detail-actions">
        <a class="action-link" href="/admin/import">
          导入 GitHub Skill <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="action-link" href="/admin/editor">
          可视化编辑器 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="action-link" href="/">
          返回公开画廊
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="detail-section admin-status-card" aria-labelledby="access-heading">
      <div class="detail-section-heading">
        <h2 id="access-heading">管理员会话</h2>
        <p>不会在浏览器保存 GitHub 凭据</p>
      </div>
      <p class="admin-session-status" data-admin-session role="status" aria-live="polite">
        正在验证服务端会话…
      </p>
      <p class="admin-safety-note">
        若 Access 或 Worker
        验证配置缺失，后台会拒绝访问；请按管理安全说明完成外部配置，不要关闭服务端校验。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="detail-section" aria-labelledby="admin-next-heading">
      <div class="detail-section-heading">
        <h2 id="admin-next-heading">工作区</h2>
        <p>当前阶段：安全只读导入预览与浏览器草稿编辑</p>
      </div>
      <a class="admin-workspace-link" href="/admin/import">
        <span>
          <strong>GitHub Skill 来源预览</strong>
          <small>输入公开仓库、目录或 SKILL.md 链接；默认不全选且不会写入</small>
        </span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
      <a class="admin-workspace-link" href="/admin/editor">
        <span>
          <strong>可视化编辑器</strong>
          <small>编辑已发布条目、预览公开卡片与详情页；草稿仅存本浏览器且不包含凭据</small>
        </span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script>
    import '../../scripts/admin-session';
  </script>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .admin-shell {
    padding-bottom: 74px;
  }

  .admin-hero {
    padding-top: 54px;
  }

  .admin-status-card {
    max-width: 760px;
    border: 1px solid #e8e6ed;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 22px;
  }

  .admin-session-status {
    margin: 0;
    color: #565760;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .admin-safety-note {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: #777880;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .admin-workspace-link {
    display: flex;
    max-width: 760px;
    min-height: 82px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #e8e6ed;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 18px 21px;
    transition: border-color 160ms ease;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .admin-workspace-link:hover {
    border-color: #cec4f0;
  }

  .admin-workspace-link span:first-child {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .admin-workspace-link small {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .admin-status-card {
      padding: 17px;
    }
  }
</style>
